    ";仅影响跟随默认的应用": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "; only affects apps following the default"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ";仅影响跟随默认的应用,%ld 个应用保留单独设置": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "; only affects apps following the default, %ld apps keep their own setting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WheelFlip 需要辅助功能权限才能修改鼠标滚轮事件,触控板不受影响。沙盒应用不会自动弹出授权对话框,需要手动添加一次。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WheelFlip needs Accessibility permission to modify mouse-wheel events; the trackpad is unaffected. A sandboxed app can’t show the system prompt, so add it manually once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WheelFlip：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WheelFlip: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“其他应用”的默认方向只影响没有单独设置的应用;已单独设置的应用不受默认值变化影响。关闭默认方向不会停止服务。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The default direction for “Other Apps” only affects apps without their own setting; customized apps are unaffected when it changes. Turning it off does not stop the service."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“退出 WheelFlip”会停止滚轮修改,并注销登录自启;下次想使用时需手动打开。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Quit WheelFlip” stops wheel modification and removes launch-at-login; open it manually next time you want it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
