    "检测到旧版命令行 wheelflip 仍在运行,可能导致滚轮方向被翻转两次,建议先卸载旧版。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The legacy wheelflip CLI is still running and may double-reverse your scroll wheel; uninstall it first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在查找应用…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finding apps…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此应用已在列表中,已定位到它": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Already in the list; located it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个应用可以单独设置“跟随默认 / 反转 / 保持原方向”。“设置应用”区域显示当前正在编辑的应用及其来源;点“选择应用…”可以手动挑选任何已安装的应用,不需要先打开或滚动它。滚轮事件归属于实际接收它的窗口所属的应用,即使该应用不在前台。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each app can be set to “Follow Default / Reverse / Keep Direction”. The “App to Configure” area shows which app you are editing and why it was selected; “Choose App…” lets you pick any installed app without opening or scrolling it first. Scroll events belong to the app whose window actually receives them, even when it isn’t in the foreground."
          }
        }
      }
    },
