    "系统会缓存权限查询结果,需要重新打开 WheelFlip 才能读到新授权。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system caches permission results; WheelFlip must be reopened to pick up a new grant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "规则文件无法读取时,WheelFlip 不会修改任何滚轮事件。如果在文件外部修复了它,可以重新读取;也可以查看备份,或在确认损失后重置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While the rules file can’t be read, WheelFlip leaves all scroll events untouched. If you fixed the file outside the app, reload it; or inspect the backup, or reset after confirming the loss."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "规则无法读取,修复设置后才能编辑此应用的方向。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
