        }
      }
    },
    "顶部显示 WheelFlip 是否在工作。“暂停全部”会临时停止修改滚轮,所有滚动原样通过;“恢复全部”继续执行规则。暂停只到本次运行为止,重新打开应用后会自动恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The top shows whether WheelFlip is active. “Pause All” temporarily stops modifying the wheel — all scrolling passes through unchanged — and “Resume All” resumes the rules. Pausing lasts only for this run; reopening the app restores the service."
          }
        }
      }
    },
